  "military_personnel_transfer_rule": "Approved career petitions may move exact officers only through physical routed transfer orders. Intra-force materialized officers are detached and attached by exact force/formation accounting while force headcount remains conserved. Cross-force, foreign-service, allegiance, custody, and ownership changes fail closed unless their separate authority permits them.",
