  "formation_military_loyalty_authority": "state/formations/*.json#military_loyalty_state",
  "military_loyalty_owner_rule": "State allegiance, institutional/professional loyalty, House/patron loyalty, commander bonds, immediate-officer loyalty, formation identity, legitimacy belief, and disaffection remain distinct pressures. Loyalty or effective allegiance never silently rewrites administrative ownership, state office, manpower title, equipment title, sovereignty, or diplomatic recognition.",
