  "military_loyalty_crisis_rule": "Rebellion, defection, mutiny, desertion, and illegal-order resistance resolve formation by formation through competing saved loyalty axes, named officers, aggregate immediate officers, hierarchy, legitimacy, and cohesion. Fragmentation conserves personnel inside the existing force and does not convert an army through one threshold.",
